+ * Swipe pages and the control sheet, device side (patch P13): what the pages read and do on the unit, the saved choice, the touch
+ * hook and the tools self.pages.status, get and set, self.page.show and self.page.tiles. Drawing is maipai_pages.cc; the rules are
+ * maipai_gesture_core.h and maipai_pages_core.h. With CONFIG_MAIPAI_PAGES off nothing here is compiled and a swipe keeps its old meaning.
+ */
